{title: Koi Yeh Kaise Bataye}
{artist: Jagjit Singh}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]koee ye kaise bataaye ke,
[Am]wo tanahaa [E]kyon hai
[E]wo jo apanaa thaa wahee aaur,
[Am]kisee kaa kyon hai
[Em]yahee duniyaan hain to fir,
[D]ayesee ye [C]duniyaan kyon hai
[E]yahee hotaa [Am]hain to,
[D]aakhir [Em]yahee hotaa [E7]kyon hai?
[D]ik jaraa haath badhaa de to,
[G]pakad [D]le daaman
[D]us ke seene mein samaa jaaye,
[G]humaaree [D]dhadakan
[E]itanee kurbat [Am]hain to fir
[D]faasalaa [Em]itanaa [E7]kyon hai
